---
title: How doc-preview handles /xorio:preview
---
flowchart TD
  A["/xorio:preview [path]"] --> B{path given?}
  B -- no --> P[File picker]
  B -- yes --> C{exists?}
  C -- no --> N["Not found: path"]
  C -- folder --> P
  C -- file --> D{.md / .mmd?}
  D -- no --> R[Refused]
  D -- yes --> V[Preview pane]
  P -- pick a file --> V
  V -- b --> W[Browser page]
  V -- w / n / z --> S[Resize]
  V -- q --> X[Closed]
